Package: SerumSourceAnalyzer
Type: Package
Title: Heavy/Light Isotope-Based Serum Source Analysis of EV Proteomics
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Xuxl", family = "NP1", email = "xuxl@example.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Classifies proteins from SILAC-style heavy/light labeled
    extracellular-vesicle (EV) proteomics data as serum-derived versus
    residual/background. Compares target EV groups against a UCEV control
    using replicate-level Light-fraction statistics, applies
    source-correction to estimate serum fractions, annotates candidates
    against in-house serum and PeptideAtlas databases, and produces
    publication-ready visualizations and a Markdown analysis report.
License: GPL-3
